                "text": "It was great to be in Stuart to drop off $1.1 million for a backup power system for the local water treatment center. \n\nIt\u2019s easy to take clean water for granted \u2014 but the second it\u2019s not available, it\u2019s an emergency. Glad to get this project done for Patrick County! https://t.co/uA3LOmlWdg",
